Description: terminal user interface for Syncthing
 syncthingtui is a terminal user interface for managing Syncthing, aiming for
 feature parity with the official Syncthing web GUI.
 .
 It allows browsing and configuring folders, remote devices, system settings,
 and active alerts directly from the console using keyboard-driven navigation.
